# solitude — near-monochrome slate (dark), from omarchy's solitude theme.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy  themes/solitude/colors.toml  (df3d01c)
# Licence:  MIT, Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
#
# Colours only; omarchy's wallpapers and images are not used. The mapping onto
# Ergon's 22 roles is ours, the same for every omarchy palette: BG0 background,
# BG1/BG2 the raised surfaces (lighter_background and selection; the darker
# step for a light ground), FG0 bright_foreground, FG1 foreground, DIM
# light_foreground, DIMMER dark_foreground, the ramp cyan/blue/magenta/yellow/
# red, HOT_* and BLUSH their bright_ forms, ACCENT blue, ACTIVE omarchy's accent.
# This theme's lighter_background equals its background, so BG1 is dark_background.
# URGENT is bright_red: the theme's red (#565D60) is a grey no brighter than the text.

COOL_BG0=#101315
COOL_BG1=#0C0E10
COOL_BG2=#343D41
COOL_FG0=#CACCCC
COOL_FG1=#A5AEB4
COOL_DIM=#798186
COOL_DIMMER=#4B4E55
COOL_0=#707070
COOL_1=#798186
COOL_2=#AEAEAE
COOL_3=#D9DBDC
COOL_4=#565D60
COOL_HOT_0=#707070
COOL_HOT_4=#DE6145
COOL_MINT=#9FA5A9
COOL_BLUSH=#9A9A9A
COOL_ACCENT=#798186
COOL_ACTIVE=#798186
COOL_URGENT=#DE6145
COOL_WARN=#D9DBDC
COOL_GOOD=#9FA5A9
COOL_INACTIVE=#343D41
